      <activity id="1c6d822b-ff2a-5a47-af05-5b7b1c67281b" activityNameId="22ff598f-50c6-537e-a48a-21a8ed70ea68" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Silicon, multi-Si, casted, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Silicon, multi-Si, casted, at plant
Solar-grade silicon demand estimated at 1 kg/kg. Electricity demand updated for 2018. The remaining production efforts remain unchanged because recent data were not available.;
CAS number: 7440-21-3; 
Formula: Si; 
Synonyms: polycrystaline; 
UUID: 55f9e540-da5e-4696-84a9-56e9254457c1
Gate to gate inventory for the casting of solar-grade Si to produce multi-crystalline silicon.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Purified silicon is melted in cast in a graphite box.
Time period: Data refer to 2005. Electricity demand updated for 2018.
Production volume: Approximately 105000 MW for total c-Si in 2018
Sampling: Literature data. 
Extrapolations: Extrapolation of European LCI data by changing the electricity mix.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_55f9e540-da5e-4696-84a9-56e9254457c1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
